IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sbgc-secrecy`

-- Statutory Bodies and Government Companies (Protection of Secrecy) Act 1983, ss 2-5 and the Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_statutory-bodies-and-government-companies-protection-of-secrecy-act-1983.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`an HDB officer leaks a confidential file to a friend` MEANS Disclosure WITH
    `the organisation` IS `Housing and Development Board`
    `the discloser is or has been a member, officer, employee or agent of it` IS TRUE
    `obtained or accessed by virtue of that position` IS TRUE
    `the document or information is secret or confidential` IS TRUE
    `the organisation authorised the disclosure` IS FALSE
    `for performing the duties or functions of a member, officer, employee or agent` IS FALSE
    `lawfully required or authorised by a court` IS FALSE
    `required or allowed by written law` IS FALSE

