§ `s 2 and the Schedule`

#ASSERT `is a specified organisation` `Central Provident Fund Board`
#ASSERT `is a specified organisation` `Communicable Diseases Agency`
#ASSERT `is a specified organisation` `Gambling Regulatory Authority of Singapore`
#ASSERT `is a specified organisation` `Majlis Ugama Islam Singapura`
#ASSERT `is a specified organisation` `Singapore Examinations and Assessment Board`
#ASSERT `is a specified organisation` `Skills and Workforce Development Agency`
#ASSERT `is a specified organisation` `PSA Corporation Limited`
#ASSERT `is a specified organisation` `a subsidiary corporation of PSA Corporation Limited`
#ASSERT NOT `is a specified organisation` `Health Sciences Authority`
#ASSERT NOT `is a specified organisation` `Accounting and Corporate Regulatory Authority`
#ASSERT NOT `is a specified organisation` `a Government ministry`
#ASSERT NOT `is a specified organisation` `a private company`

§ `s 3(1), (2)`

#ASSERT `s 3(1) reaches the disclosure` `an HDB officer leaks a confidential file to a friend`
#ASSERT `s 3(1) reaches the disclosure` `a CPF Board officer gives a confidential file to a colleague for work`
#ASSERT `s 3(1) reaches the disclosure` `a PUB employee produces a confidential document under a court order`
#ASSERT `s 3(1) reaches the disclosure` `an LTA officer discloses as allowed by written law`
#ASSERT NOT `s 3(1) reaches the disclosure` `a MAS officer discloses with the Authority's authority`
#ASSERT NOT `s 3(1) reaches the disclosure` `an NEA officer passes on information that is not confidential`
#ASSERT NOT `s 3(1) reaches the disclosure` `a URA agent discloses confidential information learned outside the role`
#ASSERT NOT `s 3(1) reaches the disclosure` `an HSA officer leaks a confidential file`
#ASSERT NOT `s 3(1) reaches the disclosure` `a member of the public passes on a leaked HDB file`

#ASSERT NOT `s 3(2) excepts the disclosure` `an HDB officer leaks a confidential file to a friend`
#ASSERT `s 3(2) excepts the disclosure` `a CPF Board officer gives a confidential file to a colleague for work`
#ASSERT `s 3(2) excepts the disclosure` `a PUB employee produces a confidential document under a court order`

§ `s 3(3)`

#ASSERT `the disclosure is an offence under s 3(3)` `an HDB officer leaks a confidential file to a friend`
#ASSERT `the disclosure is an offence under s 3(3)` `a former IRAS employee discloses a confidential taxpayer file years later`
#ASSERT NOT `the disclosure is an offence under s 3(3)` `a CPF Board officer gives a confidential file to a colleague for work`
#ASSERT NOT `the disclosure is an offence under s 3(3)` `a PUB employee produces a confidential document under a court order`
#ASSERT NOT `the disclosure is an offence under s 3(3)` `an LTA officer discloses as allowed by written law`
#ASSERT NOT `the disclosure is an offence under s 3(3)` `a MAS officer discloses with the Authority's authority`
#ASSERT NOT `the disclosure is an offence under s 3(3)` `an NEA officer passes on information that is not confidential`
#ASSERT NOT `the disclosure is an offence under s 3(3)` `a URA agent discloses confidential information learned outside the role`
#ASSERT `the disclosure is an offence under s 3(3)` `a PSA subsidiary employee leaks confidential port data`
#ASSERT NOT `the disclosure is an offence under s 3(3)` `an HSA officer leaks a confidential file`
#ASSERT NOT `the disclosure is an offence under s 3(3)` `a member of the public passes on a leaked HDB file`
#ASSERT `the disclosure is an offence under s 3(3)` `an SEAB agent leaks confidential examination papers`

